<title>ESTONIA: NOON RADIO HEADLINES - MAY 29.</title>
<headline>NOON RADIO HEADLINES - MAY 29.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the main headlines reported by Kuku Raadio on Friday at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and cannot vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- Swedish authorities are seeking the guilty parties for sinking of the Estonia.</p>
<p>- Latvia chooses a new defence minister</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
